              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "svcran"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is amazing! I used cauliflower, mini sweet peppers, white onion and some cherry tomatoes. I added minced garlic to the vinegar mixture (dried dill weed as no fresh) and tossed it &amp; threw in the oven. Not such a great smell but thank goodness my exhaust is working! Will make many times in the future!!",
