            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy to make and very delicious!! I found this recipe to be a great alternative to the variation of potato side dishes. I have never had roasted cauliflower but this dish did far from disappoint! I marinated over the two hours and substituted the pepper for a tomato, which went superbly with the balsamic marinade! Buon appetito! !",
